          "regionId": "bert.pdf:p3:region:0",
          "parent": null,
          "lines": 1,
          "mapped": true,
          "text": "2017) and machine translation (McCann et al.,"
        },
        {
          "kind": "list-item",
          "regionId": "bert.pdf:p3:region:0",
          "parent": "bert.pdf:p3:block:list:0",
          "lines": 1,
          "mapped": true,
          "text": "2017) and machine translation (McCann et al.,"
        },
        {
          "kind": "caption",
          "regionId": "bert.pdf:p3:region:0",
          "parent": null,
          "lines": 1,
          "mapped": true,
          "text": "Figure 1: Overall pre-training and fine-tuning procedures for BERT. Apart from output layers, the same architec"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "regionId": "bert.pdf:p3:region:0",
          "parent": null,
          "lines": 1,
          "mapped": true,
          "text": "tures are used in both pre-training and fine-tuning. The same pre-trained model parameters are used to initialize"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "regionId": "bert.pdf:p3:region:0",
          "parent": null,
          "lines": 1,
          "mapped": true,
          "text": "2018; Radford et al., 2018; Dai and Le, 2015)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "regionId": "bert.pdf:p3:region:0",
          "parent": null,
          "lines": 1,
          "mapped": true,
          "text": "There has also been work showing effective trans"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "regionId": "bert.pdf:p3:region:0",
          "parent": null,
          "lines": 4,
          "mapped": true,
          "text": "2017). Computer vision research has also demonstrated the importance of transfer learning from large pre-trained models, where an effective recipe is"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "regionId": "bert.pdf:p3:region:0",
          "parent": null,
          "lines": 1,
          "mapped": true,
          "text": "geNet (Deng et al., 2009; Yosinski et al., 2014)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "regionId": "bert.pdf:p3:region:0",
          "parent": null,
          "lines": 1,
          "mapped": true,
          "text": "tialized with the same pre-trained parameters. The"
        },
        {
          "kind": "heading",
          "regionId": "bert.pdf:p3:region:2",
          "parent": null,
          "lines": 1,
          "mapped": true,
          "text": "2http://nlp.seas.harvard.edu/2018/04/03/attention.html"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "regionId": "bert.pdf:p3:region:2",
          "parent": null,
          "lines": 1,
          "mapped": true,
          "text": "Model Architecture BERT’s model architec"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "regionId": "bert.pdf:p3:region:2",
          "parent": null,
          "lines": 2,
          "mapped": true,
          "text": "coder based on the original implementation described in Vaswani et al. (2017) and released in"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "regionId": "bert.pdf:p3:region:2",
          "parent": null,
          "lines": 4,
          "mapped": true,
          "text": "of Transformers has become common and our implementation is almost identical to the original, we will omit an exhaustive background description of the model architecture and refer "
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "regionId": "bert.pdf:p3:region:2",
          "parent": null,
          "lines": 2,
          "mapped": true,
          "text": "such as “The Annotated Transformer.” In this work, we denote the number of layers"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "regionId": "bert.pdf:p3:region:2",
          "parent": null,
          "lines": 1,
          "mapped": true,
          "text": "H, and the number of self-attention heads as A.3"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "regionId": "bert.pdf:p3:region:2",
          "parent": null,
          "lines": 1,
          "mapped": true,
          "text": "In all cases we set the feed-forward/filter size to be"
        },
        {
          "kind": "unknown",
          "regionId": "bert.pdf:p3:region:0",
          "parent": null,
          "lines": 1,
          "mapped": true,
          "text": "tions/answers)."
        }
      ]
    },
