          "regionId": "resnet.pdf:p4:region:0",
          "parent": null,
          "lines": 2,
          "mapped": true,
          "text": "shortcuts (Eqn.(1)) can be directly used when the input and\noutput are of the same dimensions (solid line shortcuts in"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "regionId": "resnet.pdf:p4:region:0",
          "parent": null,
          "lines": 1,
          "mapped": true,
          "text": "Fig. 3). When the dimensions increase (dotted line shortcuts"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "regionId": "resnet.pdf:p4:region:0",
          "parent": null,
          "lines": 2,
          "mapped": true,
          "text": "3x3 conv, 128 7x7 conv, 64, /2 7x7 conv, 64, /2\npool, /2 pool, /2 pool, /2"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "regionId": "resnet.pdf:p4:region:0",
          "parent": null,
          "lines": 2,
          "mapped": true,
          "text": "for increasing dimensions. This option introduces no extra"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "regionId": "resnet.pdf:p4:region:0",
          "parent": null,
          "lines": 1,
          "mapped": true,
          "text": "3x3 conv, 256 3x3 conv, 64 3x3 conv, 64"
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "regionId": "resnet.pdf:p4:region:0",
          "parent": null,
